Package: cudaGlmnet
Type: Package
Title: Minimal GPU Gaussian Lasso via rcupp
Version: 0.0.0.9008
Authors@R: person("Joe", "Zhu", email = "sha.joe.zhu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Joe Zhu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Joe Zhu <sha.joe.zhu@gmail.com>
Description: A glmnet-like interface for the Gaussian lasso and elastic net
    solved by GPU FISTA through the low-level 'rcupp' package. Provides lambda
    paths, cross-validation, standardization and an intercept, with
    coef/predict methods using glmnet-style 's' selection. Elastic-net
    mixing is composed downstream (Rcpp glue plus rcupp substrate) from
    rcupp's resident device operators; rcupp itself stays algorithm-agnostic.
    The single fixed-lambda cuda_lasso() entry point is retained as the
    numerical reference path. Sparse x and other families are future work.
